<title>ROMANIA: Romanians start new year with tremor.</title>
<headline>Romanians start new year with tremor.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romanians started the new year shaken by an earthquake measuring 4.2 on the Richter scale but no damage was reported, scientists said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tremor struck at 3.44 a.m. (0144 GMT) in the eastern region of Vrancea and was slighlty felt in Bucharest, Adrian Grigore of the National Earth Physics Institute said. There were no immediate reports of damage or casualties.</p>
</text>
